{"parse": {"title": "12TH-02", "pageid": 127787, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-01\" title=\"12TH-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">12TH-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/12TH-03\" title=\"12TH-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">12TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B0.B8.E6.81.92.E7.9A.84.E7.A7.8B.E5.A4.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"永恒的秋天\">永恒的秋天</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 永恒的秋天</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Eternal Autumn</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/220132\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E7%95%94%E5%A4%9C%E8%AF%9D\" title=\"河畔夜话\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%B3%E7%95%94%E5%A4%9C%E8%AF%9D\" title=\"河畔夜话\"><img alt=\"河畔夜话\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Item-220132.png/100px-Item-220132.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Item-220132.png/150px-Item-220132.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/Item-220132.png/200px-Item-220132.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">1</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>金<span class=\"color-value\"></span>色<span class=\"color-value\"></span>啊<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>再<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>太<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>赐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>予<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>再<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>丰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>饶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>摇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>篮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11202</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顿河下游的平缓草甸上，土围子和原木围出了一块营地。不比一座堡垒更大，但足以让一支军队歇下脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>芝诺骑兵军军长伊万·伊万诺维奇·布列科夫正在观看一群新兵按照芝诺操典练习队列。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-529815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>军长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声问候之后，芝诺骑兵军参谋长莎宾娜·斯捷尔诺娃迎面走来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>有什么事吗，莎宾娜？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我看你从指挥室里出来了，有什么要指示的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>只是出来透透气，帐篷里太闷热了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>另外，最近又有很多新兵入伍，我多出来走一走，能帮助他们记住自己的军长长什么样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>的确如此，但我相信他们已经认识你了。很多人都是在你亲自去村子里动员的时候，才决定加入骑兵军的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>那也不错。有些新人是红柳树村来的，他们有带来什么新消息吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>你想问的是佳琳娜夫人？——她一切都好，说希望有机会再见你一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>最近骑兵军不会有大动作，应该能抽出一点时间去看看她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>只是，“金色饥荒”一直持续的话，她继续留在顿河也不安全了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>冬天迟迟不肯到来，依靠土地生长的作物又没法自然生长……要想个办法劝她离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>我们早就向基金会报告了顿河的饥荒，可答应派来解决气候异常的调查员至今没见到踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这里不是战争的焦点地区，人手不足的时候，基金会是不会在乎顿河的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>营地入口处传来杂沓的马蹄声，这是营内常见的“意外发生”预兆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>——怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-300412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——让一让，别顾着你们的队列了，新兵蛋子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/27/HeadIconSmall-530401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅰ：</div><div>是啊，你们没听到这家伙的鬼哭狼嚎吗？太可怜了，我都要替他流眼泪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>匆忙进入营地的马队后方，缀着一名被绑在马背上的哀嚎着的伤员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529925.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-529925.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529925.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529925.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-529925.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529925.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-529925.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529925.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>你——你可闭嘴吧，萨沙。我中弹了——中弹了！你明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529922.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529922.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>疼啊，太疼了——我要废了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>营地里的士兵纷纷为归营的侦察队让开通路。红弩箭率先在开阔处下马，接着是除了谢尔盖之外的其他队员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"530501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"530501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-530501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-530501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">芝诺骑兵Ⅱ：</div><div>谢尔盖交给我吧，中尉。你去找军长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>没问题，你最好想个办法让他住嘴，否则他迟早要对营地里的每个人都讲一遍受伤的英勇壮举。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她刚刚转过身，就看见了正在向事发现场走来的骑兵军指挥官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我就在这里，出什么事了，中尉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>出了些小意外，在下一批飞行扫帚的零件送到前我飞不了了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>但这还不是最糟的，军长，我想我们碰上了一些真正的大麻烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>和我到指挥室说。莎宾娜，你也一起来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-3_3_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>……芝诺装备的AZP-37高射炮，还有神秘术引导的近炸防空炮弹，出现在匪军手中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>这一切你都很有把握吗，中尉？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我不会看错。我还在受训的时候，教官就是用这种炮来让我们练习规避——当然，装的是训练弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>骑兵军近期没有丢失武器的记录，更不用说我们根本没有装备这个型号的高射炮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军中物资流向牢记于心的参谋长率先排除了部分可能性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>也就是说可以假定AZP-37是从外部进入顿河流域的。进一步说，有很大可能匪军还藏有更多类似的重武器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>从外部的话……空运是绝无可能的，而从外部进入骑兵军管辖区的主要陆地与航运通道都处在监视之下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>要说匪军熟悉环境，知道某些隐藏的小路，那骑兵军里的本地士兵也一样会知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>目前看不出匪军有什么办法将大量武器和人员运送到顿河流域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>比起渠道，更重要的是供应者——除芝诺本身之外，有谁掌握芝诺装备？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>也许是重塑之手在其他战场缴获了我方的武器，然后把它们提供给了顿河的匪军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>把一切都推给重塑之手确实是个省事的思路，不过我看这种可能性并不是很大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>匪军里的人类多到能让基金会心花怒放。相比合作，重塑之手应该更想把他们一起消灭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>另外，匪军在遭受损失之后就立刻逃跑，他们没有表现出受重塑之手控制的那种疯狂的进攻性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我们还是谈谈另外一种可能性吧——有没有可能是伊戈尔的叛军？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑兵军将领们的表情凝固了一秒，就连烛光也突然静滞。<br />可抛出话题的中尉却仿佛与空气中的情绪完全隔绝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>他也有能力从非常规渠道投送人员和武器，对吧，军长？我记得你以前在伊戈尔手下干过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>中尉，我需要纠正一点——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>没错，在伊戈尔手下的时候，我了解过他的神秘术。他的确有办法突破封锁投送武器和人员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>好消息是，伊戈尔在南极仪式之后和重塑之手闹掰了。无论是哪一种可能，我们只要面对两个麻烦中的一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这种程度的好消息还无法驱散军长眼窝中沉积着的一片铁灰色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>就算假定是伊戈尔，不明朗之处还有很多。他和他所谓的狮鹫军到距离前线上千公里的别列格勒附近做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>就算这里有什么他想要的东西，他又为什么和匪军合作？——据我对他的了解，他可看不起土匪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>他想要补给？可“金色饥荒”已经让顿河地区颗粒无收，还是说他就是这场饥荒的始作俑者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人的追问快要逐渐演化为焦躁的絮语，他赶紧制止自己继续说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>我会把这件事告知指挥部，情报部门应该能分析出更多可靠的信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>莎宾娜，把巡逻队的人数和任务频率都提高一倍，重点关照较为隐蔽的林地地区。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">斯捷尔诺娃：</div><div>遵命，军长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">军长伊万：</div><div>红弩箭中尉，骑术不是你的专长，所以，在飞行扫帚修好之前，我要求你留在营地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>飞行女巫想说些什么来反驳对她骑术的否定，但还是把话咽了回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>——好吧，我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_10\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_10\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/Cg-3_3_bg_10.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_10.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这个钟点，很容易就能找到营地里的野战厨房——烤无酵饼的香气会引导饥饿的人穿越营帐构成的迷宫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>倒是正好赶上了饭点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她在一只硕大的汤锅前瞄到了与其他士兵站在一起的谢尔盖，他正端着碗，一边往口中塞食物一边不停说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529923.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-529923.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529923.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529923.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-529923.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529923.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-529923.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529923.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>……说时迟那时快，朋友，我仿佛是看到子弹朝我飞过来。真的，一定是我身上的护身符起作用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529922.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529922.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>我赶忙一个侧身，虽然是躲过了致命伤，但子弹还是往我腿肚子里打去了。你们绝对想不到那是什么滋味……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-300401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我看你恢复得挺快啊，谢尔盖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529921.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-529921.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529921.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529921.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-529921.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529921.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-529921.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529921.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>中尉，你来了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谢尔盖手中的碗一抖，不自觉地并腿立正，些许菜汤洒在他的手指缝里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>刚把腿肚子里的子弹取出来，你就能自己走来捞汤喝了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>那……那是当然，我可是钢筋铁骨。唉，说到这汤啊——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他举起手中的碗，容器内是泡着一张饼的卷心菜汤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529922.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529922.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/HeadIconSmall-529922.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529922.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>你看看我们吃的是什么东西啊？当兵的不能就靠这些东西过活呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>别抱怨了，你自己不是藏了一些肉干吗？——拿出来吃了吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭也从供餐处拿走一块饼，又从汤锅中舀起一碗汤。纤薄的菜叶像是一片浸湿的纱布一般沉在碗底。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>和所有人的吃法一样，红弩箭也用菜汤来泡软干硬的无酵饼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谢尔盖掏出一些肉干交给红弩箭，自己又从身后拿出一瓶藏好的饮料。瓶中的液体清亮透明，看似无害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529924.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529924.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529924.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529924.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529924.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529924.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-529924.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529924.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>给，你也喝点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>这还不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>……所以，到底是怎么回事，土匪手里怎么会有那样厉害的玩意儿，能把你都打下来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>现在谁也说不准匪军是怎么搞到这些玩意儿的，也不知道他们想拿这些武器干什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>这还不好猜吗？！他们当然是要去打劫村子……这可糟了，村子里留守的那点人可遭不住这种火力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年哥萨克脸上的阴云来了又去，他的心很快被另一个念头占据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>我听说咱们队下午没有安排，你要不要和我一起去河边网点鱼？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>在这种时候捞鱼？你不怕会被人一枪打死吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>我知道安全的地方，再说，我随身带着护身符，子弹打不死我的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>就算是在打仗，没有东西吃也不行。虽然麦子不长了，但河里一定还有不少鱼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红弩箭以审视的目光查看谢尔盖据说中弹了的小腿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>我记得你腿肚子不是被打坏了吗，这就能去捞鱼了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"529901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"529901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-529901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-529901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">谢尔盖：</div><div>这、这没什么妨碍的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谢尔盖几口扒拉完最后的食物，放下碗跑远了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">红弩箭：</div><div>呵，我看顶多就是被擦破了一点皮。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_02\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_3_bg_02.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_3_bg_02.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-3_3_bg_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>干热的风袭来，被压到不满半人高的针茅草形成层叠的、沙沙作响的浪涌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这里是马儿的乐园，但却会让疲于奔命的逃亡者叫苦不迭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>卡戎，离开大路之后，我们已经走了多远？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在辽阔的草原上游走，通常会陷入数小时不见人烟的困境。光靠无垠的草浪无法判断自己究竟身处何方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>按照平时步行的速度，我们应该是往东南走了十五公里，但也许现在我们的速度要比之前更慢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你累了吗，要不要休息一下？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>唉，再往前走走吧，这里怎么看都不像是能休息的地方……你觉得车夫给我们的地图可靠吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你说的是哪一个车夫？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我还是再帮你回忆一下之前发生的事吧，这已经是第不知道多少次了，卡戎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>就从离开波兰之后说起，我们稀里糊涂地搭上了一辆满是捷克斯洛伐克人的火车，和他们一起往东走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>是因为稀里糊涂吗？好像是他们告诉你，再往东走就不会见到黑衣的军队，然后你就吵着要上车了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>噢……这你倒记得了。总之他们让我们上车，可还没走多远，火车就被另一伙不知道是什么的人拦下来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>再之后，到处都是枪响。我们去载马的车厢把安德烈森救走，趁乱往南逃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴咴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战马对那场惊心动魄的营救行动仍然心存感激。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>之后就是我说的那个车夫，他丢了一匹马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我们和他商量了一个办法——安德烈森借他拉一天的车，而他要告诉我们往哪里走更安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>那么，这确实是一个安全的地方，四周都很安宁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>但我要的安全不是这种啊！——再找不到有人的地方，我们，不对，只有我会饿死在路上的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不用进食的亡者低下头，仿佛是在为自己考虑不周而失落。<br />安德烈森也别过脑袋——它倒是能靠嚼草根过活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>别这样啊，我又不是在怪你们……算了，除了往前走也没有什么更好的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她再次举起极尽潦草的手绘地图，用尽了全部的想象力，才从混乱的线条中辨认出一条河的形状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>他说我们可以到渡河口村找他的侄子，就在顿河边……可到底哪条河才是顿河？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>假定我们的确没有走错路，再假定车夫的地图比例没有太过夸张，呃……安德烈森？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">安德烈森：</div><div>咴咴？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-531712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>让我在你背上站一会儿，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑马屈膝下伏，少女四肢并用爬上马背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，人和马一同站起，梅蕾尔双腿颤抖着立在马背上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡戎：</div><div>你在做什么，梅蕾尔？你会摔下来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我、我没事，我——我要摔下来的时候，你、你可要接住我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>梅蕾尔哆哆嗦嗦地举起从途经的一座废墟中捡来的望远镜，向她认为的东方看去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_40.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_40\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_40\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/HeadIconSmall-531711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>是在哪儿……这边什么也没有，全都是草，树林……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/HeadIconSmall-531710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>另一边呢？……另一边——嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531717.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531717.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531717.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531717.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531717.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531717.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531717.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531717.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>卡、卡戎，我好像看到屋顶了！就在前面，你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-531714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>救命！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_at_40.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_at_40\"><img alt=\"3_3_at_40\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/600px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/900px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1e/Cg-3_3_at_40.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_at_40.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>少女激动得手舞足蹈，如预料之中的那般失去了平衡。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "12TH-02"}}